{
  "_readme": [
    "このファイルは『売買物件検索』の自動操作手順です。プログラムを書き換えずに、",
    "ここ（JSON）を編集するだけで手順や特定条件を調整できます。",
    "",
    "各ステップの意味:",
    "  id                : ステップの識別名（スクショのファイル名にも使われます）",
    "  description       : 何をするかの説明（ログに出ます）",
    "  action            : 操作の種類。click / fill / select / choose / check / scroll /",
    "                      wait_for / wait_ms / verify / screenshot / dump_html",
    "  targets           : 対象の特定候補。上から順に試し、最初に見つかったものを使います。",
    "                      by = label / role / text / placeholder / name / id / css / xpath",
    "  value             : fill(入力) / select / choose で使う値",
    "  verify            : 操作後の確認条件（contains / visible_targets / not_contains）",
    "  scroll_into_view  : true にすると対象が画面内に来るまでスクロールします",
    "  optional          : true にすると、このステップが失敗しても止めずに次へ進みます",
    "  coordinate_fallback : [x, y]。HTMLで特定できない時だけ使う座標（補助手段）",
    "",
    "★検索条件（物件種別・沿線・価格）について:",
    "  条件の値はここに直接書かず、起動時の『検索条件の設定画面』で入力します",
    "  （保存先: config/search_conditions.json）。value の {{ensen1_start}} などが差し込み記号です。",
    "  requires に書いた条件が空欄（または沿線の『使う』がオフ）のステップは自動で省略されます。",
    "  差し込み記号: shubetsu1 / ensen1_line, ensen1_start, ensen1_end, ensen1_walk（2,3も同様）/ price_min, price_max",
    "",
    "★沿線の入力方式:",
    "  REINSの『入力ガイド』ポップアップは使わず、沿線1〜3の入力欄へ直接入力します。",
    "  沿線欄にだけある『駅名』ラベル(N個目=沿線N)を起点に、preceding::input[1]=沿線名、",
    "  following::input[1]=始駅、[2]=終駅、[3]=駅から徒歩、following::select[1]=徒歩の単位。"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "open_baibai_search",
      "description": "「売買物件検索」を探してクリックする",
      "action": "click",
      "targets": [
        {
          "by": "role",
          "value": "売買物件検索",
          "options": {
            "role": "link"
          }
        },
        {
          "by": "text",
          "value": "売買物件検索"
        }
      ],
      "verify": {
        "contains": "物件種別"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "select_bukken_shubetsu1_baimansion",
      "description": "「物件種別1」から「{{shubetsu1}}」を選択する",
      "action": "choose",
      "value": "{{shubetsu1}}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "by": "css",
          "value": "select:has(option:text-is('{{shubetsu1}}'))"
        },
        {
          "by": "label",
          "value": "物件種別1"
        },
        {
          "by": "name",
          "value": "bukkenShubetsu1"
        },
        {
          "by": "css",
          "value": "select[name*='shubetsu']"
        }
      ],
      "note": "選んだ種別の選択肢を持つ<select>を直接狙う。.first で物件種別1を選ぶ。",
      "requires": [
        "shubetsu1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ensen1_senro",
      "description": "沿線1 沿線名「{{ensen1_line}}」を入力（駅名がある場合は必須・完全一致）",
      "action": "fill",
      "value": "{{ensen1_line}}",
      "scroll_into_view": true,
      "targets": [
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "(//*[contains(text(),'駅名')])[1]/preceding::input[1]"
        }
      ],
      "note": "駅名ラベルの直前のinput=沿線名。正式表記が違えばvalueを変更（完全一致のため）。",
      "requires": [
        "ensen1_line"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ensen1_start_eki",
      "description": "沿線1 始駅「{{ensen1_start}}」を入力",
      "action": "fill",
      "value": "{{ensen1_start}}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "(//*[contains(text(),'駅名')])[1]/following::input[1]"
        },
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "//*[normalize-space()='沿線1']/following::input[2]"
        },
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "//*[normalize-space()='沿線１']/following::input[2]"
        }
      ],
      "requires": [
        "ensen1_start"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ensen1_end_eki",
      "description": "沿線1 終駅「{{ensen1_end}}」を入力",
      "action": "fill",
      "value": "{{ensen1_end}}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "(//*[contains(text(),'駅名')])[1]/following::input[2]"
        },
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "//*[normalize-space()='沿線1']/following::input[3]"
        },
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "//*[normalize-space()='沿線１']/following::input[3]"
        }
      ],
      "requires": [
        "ensen1_end"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ensen1_walk",
      "description": "沿線1 駅から徒歩に {{ensen1_walk}} を入力",
      "action": "fill",
      "value": "{{ensen1_walk}}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "(//*[contains(text(),'駅名')])[1]/following::input[3]"
        },
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "//*[normalize-space()='沿線1']/following::input[4]"
        }
      ],
      "requires": [
        "ensen1_walk"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ensen1_walk_unit",
      "description": "沿線1 徒歩の単位を「分」に",
      "action": "select",
      "value": "分",
      "optional": true,
      "targets": [
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "(//*[contains(text(),'駅名')])[1]/following::select[1]"
        },
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "//*[normalize-space()='沿線1']/following::select[1]"
        }
      ],
      "note": "単位プルダウン。既定が分なら失敗しても続行(optional)。",
      "requires": [
        "ensen1_walk"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ensen2_senro",
      "description": "沿線2 沿線名「{{ensen2_line}}」を入力（駅名がある場合は必須・完全一致）",
      "action": "fill",
      "value": "{{ensen2_line}}",
      "scroll_into_view": true,
      "targets": [
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "(//*[contains(text(),'駅名')])[2]/preceding::input[1]"
        }
      ],
      "requires": [
        "ensen2_line"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ensen2_start_eki",
      "description": "沿線2 始駅「{{ensen2_start}}」を入力",
      "action": "fill",
      "value": "{{ensen2_start}}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "(//*[contains(text(),'駅名')])[2]/following::input[1]"
        },
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "//*[normalize-space()='沿線2']/following::input[2]"
        },
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "//*[normalize-space()='沿線２']/following::input[2]"
        }
      ],
      "requires": [
        "ensen2_start"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ensen2_end_eki",
      "description": "沿線2 終駅「{{ensen2_end}}」を入力",
      "action": "fill",
      "value": "{{ensen2_end}}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "(//*[contains(text(),'駅名')])[2]/following::input[2]"
        },
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "//*[normalize-space()='沿線2']/following::input[3]"
        },
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "//*[normalize-space()='沿線２']/following::input[3]"
        }
      ],
      "requires": [
        "ensen2_end"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ensen2_walk",
      "description": "沿線2 駅から徒歩に {{ensen2_walk}} を入力",
      "action": "fill",
      "value": "{{ensen2_walk}}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "(//*[contains(text(),'駅名')])[2]/following::input[3]"
        },
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "//*[normalize-space()='沿線2']/following::input[4]"
        }
      ],
      "requires": [
        "ensen2_walk"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ensen2_walk_unit",
      "description": "沿線2 徒歩の単位を「分」に",
      "action": "select",
      "value": "分",
      "optional": true,
      "targets": [
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "(//*[contains(text(),'駅名')])[2]/following::select[1]"
        },
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "//*[normalize-space()='沿線2']/following::select[1]"
        }
      ],
      "requires": [
        "ensen2_walk"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ensen3_senro",
      "description": "沿線3 沿線名「{{ensen3_line}}」を入力（駅名がある場合は必須・完全一致）",
      "action": "fill",
      "value": "{{ensen3_line}}",
      "scroll_into_view": true,
      "targets": [
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "(//*[contains(text(),'駅名')])[3]/preceding::input[1]"
        }
      ],
      "requires": [
        "ensen3_line"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ensen3_start_eki",
      "description": "沿線3 始駅「{{ensen3_start}}」を入力",
      "action": "fill",
      "value": "{{ensen3_start}}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "(//*[contains(text(),'駅名')])[3]/following::input[1]"
        },
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "//*[normalize-space()='沿線3']/following::input[2]"
        },
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "//*[normalize-space()='沿線３']/following::input[2]"
        }
      ],
      "requires": [
        "ensen3_start"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ensen3_end_eki",
      "description": "沿線3 終駅「{{ensen3_end}}」を入力",
      "action": "fill",
      "value": "{{ensen3_end}}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "(//*[contains(text(),'駅名')])[3]/following::input[2]"
        },
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "//*[normalize-space()='沿線3']/following::input[3]"
        },
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "//*[normalize-space()='沿線３']/following::input[3]"
        }
      ],
      "requires": [
        "ensen3_end"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ensen3_walk",
      "description": "沿線3 駅から徒歩に {{ensen3_walk}} を入力",
      "action": "fill",
      "value": "{{ensen3_walk}}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "(//*[contains(text(),'駅名')])[3]/following::input[3]"
        },
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "//*[normalize-space()='沿線3']/following::input[4]"
        }
      ],
      "requires": [
        "ensen3_walk"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ensen3_walk_unit",
      "description": "沿線3 徒歩の単位を「分」に",
      "action": "select",
      "value": "分",
      "optional": true,
      "targets": [
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "(//*[contains(text(),'駅名')])[3]/following::select[1]"
        },
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "//*[normalize-space()='沿線3']/following::select[1]"
        }
      ],
      "requires": [
        "ensen3_walk"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dump_after_ensen",
      "description": "（診断）沿線入力後の画面HTMLを保存（価格欄の構造把握用）",
      "action": "dump_html",
      "optional": true
    },
    {
      "id": "scroll_to_price",
      "description": "価格欄まで下方向にスクロール",
      "action": "scroll",
      "value": 500
    },
    {
      "id": "price_min",
      "description": "価格の下限に {{price_min}}（万円）を入力",
      "action": "fill",
      "value": "{{price_min}}",
      "scroll_into_view": true,
      "targets": [
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "//*[normalize-space()='価格']/following::input[1]"
        },
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "//*[normalize-space()='価格(万円)']/following::input[1]"
        },
        {
          "by": "name",
          "value": "priceLow"
        },
        {
          "by": "name",
          "value": "priceMin"
        }
      ],
      "note": "価格欄の構造は dump_after_ensen のHTMLで確認できる。空欄なら省略。",
      "requires": [
        "price_min"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "price_max",
      "description": "価格の上限に {{price_max}}（万円）を入力",
      "action": "fill",
      "value": "{{price_max}}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "//*[normalize-space()='価格']/following::input[2]"
        },
        {
          "by": "xpath",
          "value": "//*[normalize-space()='価格(万円)']/following::input[2]"
        },
        {
          "by": "name",
          "value": "priceHigh"
        },
        {
          "by": "name",
          "value": "priceMax"
        }
      ],
      "requires": [
        "price_max"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "click_search",
      "description": "「検索」ボタン（右下・緑）をクリック",
      "action": "click",
      "targets": [
        {
          "by": "role",
          "value": "検索",
          "options": {
            "role": "button"
          }
        },
        {
          "by": "text",
          "value": "検索する"
        },
        {
          "by": "text",
          "value": "検索"
        },
        {
          "by": "css",
          "value": "button[type='submit']"
        }
      ],
      "note": "色や位置ではなくボタン名で特定します。名称が違えばtargetsを調整。"
    },
    {
      "id": "wait_results",
      "description": "検索結果の表示を待つ",
      "action": "wait_ms",
      "value": 3000
    },
    {
      "id": "dump_results",
      "description": "（診断）結果画面のHTMLを保存",
      "action": "dump_html",
      "optional": true
    },
    {
      "id": "select_all_in_page",
      "description": "「ページ内全選択」をクリック",
      "action": "click",
      "targets": [
        {
          "by": "role",
          "value": "ページ内全選択",
          "options": {
            "role": "button"
          }
        },
        {
          "by": "text",
          "value": "ページ内全選択"
        },
        {
          "by": "text",
          "value": "全選択"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "click_zumen_ikkatsu",
      "description": "「図面の一括取得」をクリック",
      "action": "click",
      "targets": [
        {
          "by": "role",
          "value": "図面一括取得",
          "options": {
            "role": "button"
          }
        },
        {
          "by": "text",
          "value": "図面の一括取得"
        },
        {
          "by": "text",
          "value": "図面一括取得"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "wait_dialog",
      "description": "確認ポップアップの表示を待つ",
      "action": "wait_ms",
      "value": 1500
    },
    {
      "id": "dialog_ikkatsu",
      "description": "ポップアップ内の「一括取得」を押して図面をダウンロード保存",
      "action": "click_download",
      "targets": [
        {
          "by": "css",
          "value": ".modal.show button:text-is('一括取得')"
        },
        {
          "by": "css",
          "value": ".modal.show >> text=一括取得"
        },
        {
          "by": "role",
          "value": "一括取得",
          "options": {
            "role": "button",
            "exact": true
          }
        },
        {
          "by": "text",
          "value": "一括取得",
          "options": {
            "exact": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "note": "click_download=クリック前にダウンロードを予約(expect_download)して確保し、REINSがウィンドウを閉じる前に downloads フォルダへ保存する。"
    },
    {
      "id": "wait_download",
      "description": "図面ダウンロードの後処理を待つ",
      "action": "wait_ms",
      "value": 3000
    }
  ]
}
